8-3337-479b-a1be-b2eb33f263c2","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"私は cron のほうが好き…","ts":"1630235307.029600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QG6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faf347ee-53cc-4ae9-9a82-08e880fce20a","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"先を越されたｗ","ts":"1630235288.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hu5O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4bfdaaf-c0bd-45f1-b279-c42fb8dc5b27","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"比較対象がcronなのがだめか","ts":"1630235286.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8kLiN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b26ef127-c245-4d90-858e-8acfde1d8318","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Windows のタスクスケジューラが使いやすいかどうかは…","ts":"1630235271.028400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]},{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vQfh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43eff3f0-2d33-4469-8e80-ae264998d15c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"OSに設定しやすいスケジューラーが付いてるのはいいですね、cronつらい","ts":"1630235253.028000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9NUlE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2be6a35b-5fa8-4038-85f5-05ee7c22ea38","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"Windowsだとタスクスケジューラーでまとめて管理出来るので便利そう\nWSLもwsl.exe経由でコマンド流せるし","ts":"1630235197.027600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"46K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f013fcea-09e7-49dd-91c5-19b3357d32d9","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"なるほどtarball…やや手間ですが、やったほうが良さそうですね\nNAS！ようやくポータブルストレージに手を出した身としては急に何段かグレードの上がったように感じる概念だ\n定期的にNASにtarballを保存するスクリプトを走らせる、とかできたら便利そう","ts":"1630234825.026500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"04uuo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d6f86a3-1a79-42a9-8648-640c06873b39","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"バックアップは何も考えずにファイル入れてるだけでパーミッション周りは分からないな・・・","ts":"1630231116.023200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+//5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7465b563-5733-458c-a860-b71f68a1ccbe","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"NASにぶっこんでます","ts":"1630231087.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eggplant","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U8CC7MDCL","U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ac/aH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85DDE3ED-EEE5-4B06-B5A7-73F089A17D6C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"おっ、漢は黙って tar ボールだ！","ts":"1630230977.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QVsnF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab2ccc96-c6a5-489a-bb83-902bd7d384e5","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"wslだけでいうと `wsl.exe --export \u0026lt;Distro\u0026gt; \u0026lt;FileName\u0026gt;` でtarが吐けるのでそれでガバッと取っちゃうと良さそう。\n特定のファイルだけ取りたいならwsl内でtar.gzとか取っちゃえばパーミッション気にしなくて良いと思います。","ts":"1630230051.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=q+J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b48d5f39-25e2-4d0f-9e5a-ec8edb488200","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1630219848178200\u003e\nこちらのほうが良いのではということでこちらでお聞きします\n特にWSL環境はフォルダコピーだけではPermissionあたりがめちゃくちゃになる覚えがあり\n単にユーザーフォルダをコピーするだけでは不十分っぽい気がしています","ts":"1630228980.020100","attachments":[{"fallback":"[August 28th, 2021 11:50 PM] stip2222: 外部ストレージというものをほぼ持ったことがなくて、つい先日SandiskのSSDを買ってその小ささ軽さ容量にびっくりしつつ\nいざなんかに使ってみよう！と思うとバックアップくらいしか思いつかなかったんですが\nWindowsのバックアップってみなさんどうされてます？ユーザーフォルダをコピーして突っ込むだけ？","id":1,"author_id":"UFBGUPDP0","author_name":"starnak","author_subname":"starnak","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UFBGUPDP0","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-05-22/2093614261811_84f3f2cc78a6aa4948bf_48.png","text":"外部ストレージというものをほぼ持ったことがなくて、つい先日SandiskのSSDを買ってその小ささ軽さ容量にびっくりしつつ\nいざなんかに使ってみよう！と思うとバックアップくらいしか思いつかなかったんですが\nWindowsのバックアップってみなさんどうされてます？ユーザーフォルダをコピーして突っ込むだけ？","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-gadget","ts":1630219848.178200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1630219848178200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1630219848178200"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7RS6/"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"\u003c@UFBGUPDP0\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630228771.018600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U02D2M2EY1X","text":"\u003c@U02D2M2EY1X\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630227176.018300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d611bc9b-63ed-4997-ad85-3e1a7a1489cf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"自分のマザボがどこまで対応しているのか全く把握していない…","ts":"1630208804.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8EM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87f031a9-4be9-417e-a190-5b2cbfe8df9f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いつ買い換えるかなー","ts":"1630194476.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JmsJ9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df3582e6-e583-4d70-a49e-84b0c44561fd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それはそう","ts":"1630194465.017300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"krWJM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb758e0a-b8f2-4fbb-83f9-f43e48646022","type":"